Title: Switching Yard
Credit: Written by
Author: Sample fixture (shooting-script profile; defects injected on purpose)
Contact: fixture@example.com

FADE IN:

1 INT. YARD OFFICE - DAY 1

Timetables curling off the wall. FRANK OSEI (50s), yardmaster, works a
radio handset with one thumb.

FRANK
Nine's late again. Hold the interchange.

RADIO (V.O.)
Copy nine.

2 EXT. HUMP TRACK - DAY 2

CONTINUED:

Cars roll away one at a time. LEO (20s), new, watches from the ladder.

FRANK
Retarders are yours today.

LEO
Since when.

FRANK
Since Marek called in.

3 EXT. HUMP TRACK - CONTINUOUS

Leo takes the lever. A cut of three rolls past too fast.

LEO
That's hot.

FRANK
Then stop it.

(MORE)

FRANK (CONT'D)
Stop it now.

5 INT. RETARDER TOWER - DAY 5

Leo hauls the brake. Steel screams. The cut settles.

FRANK
Better.

4 EXT. HUMP TRACK - DUSK 4

Frank walks the ballast alone, counting couplers under his breath.

INT. YARD OFFICE - NIGHT

The radio is quiet. Frank writes up the day by hand.

FRANK
Nine came in at four.

LEO
It's nine.

FRANK
It came in at four.

FADE OUT.
